@startuml
title Deep Research route
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "deep-research" as ARSU
database "Project files" as Files
Agent -> CLI : instructions profile:research-main
CLI --> Agent : specs + handoff prerequisites\noutputs + Gates + cost
Agent -> User : route summary
User --> Agent : confirm
Agent -> CLI : start
CLI -> Files : run.yaml + graph.yaml + handoff.md
Agent -> ARSU : semantic research task
ARSU -> Files : external research output
ARSU -> Files : update owning handoff
opt formal Gate
  Agent -> User : Verify recommendation
  User --> Agent : confirm verdict
  Agent -> CLI : decide gate:<instance>/<gate>
end
Agent -> CLI : advance node:<run>/<node>
@enduml
